WEBVTT

00:00:08.860 --> 00:00:11.400
"Kodomo no Odocha"

00:00:11.570 --> 00:00:13.740
That rumor that I love you

00:00:14.320 --> 00:00:17.370
is true, yes it is.

00:00:18.700 --> 00:00:20.870
You can't ignore it either.

00:00:23.080 --> 00:00:25.460
Whether you're awake or asleep,

00:00:25.960 --> 00:00:29.090
please don't be embarrassed.

00:00:34.300 --> 00:00:36.640
Is it a sin if I sneak into your heart

00:00:37.140 --> 00:00:40.390
by ridding you...

00:00:41.390 --> 00:00:43.520
...of your other love?

00:00:45.900 --> 00:00:48.110
At sunset,

00:00:48.730 --> 00:00:50.610
when the children go home,

00:00:50.820 --> 00:00:54.570
Today's incident is burning love!

00:00:54.700 --> 00:00:58.450
You can tell it accurately.

00:00:58.740 --> 00:01:00.540
7 O'Clock News!

00:01:00.870 --> 00:01:04.330
Please, our relationship...

00:01:05.370 --> 00:01:09.960
Please don't blame it on the true kiss

00:01:10.130 --> 00:01:11.840
In a city without light,

00:01:12.460 --> 00:01:15.680
let's burn the fire of love.

00:01:16.760 --> 00:01:19.100
Don't be so easy going

00:01:19.180 --> 00:01:21.390
The existence is a mistake

00:01:21.760 --> 00:01:24.890
You're asking for something not there.

00:01:31.770 --> 00:01:35.110
I'm Kurata Sana, a 6th grader
and TV personality.

00:01:35.110 --> 00:01:38.450
My Aoki award-winning Mama.
The chipmunk on her head is Maro-chan.

00:01:38.450 --> 00:01:41.780
My chauffeur, manager,
and ex-pimp, Rei-kun.

00:01:41.780 --> 00:01:43.450
The mysterious white bat straight man.

00:01:43.450 --> 00:01:45.460
I'm Babbit.

00:01:45.460 --> 00:01:49.130
Hayama Akito, my natural enemy
and good friend, I suppose.

00:01:49.130 --> 00:01:52.130
Father Hayama, the strange dad.
Though Father Hayama is still pretty cool.

00:01:52.130 --> 00:01:54.460
Also, Natsumi-san, Hayama's older sister.

00:01:54.460 --> 00:01:57.590
The intrigue-loving Grandma Shizuka,
the mistress of Kurata Inn,

00:01:57.590 --> 00:01:58.800
in the Kusatsu hot springs.

00:01:58.800 --> 00:02:01.140
Kurata Inn's second-in-charge and
candidate for head clerk, Katagiri-san.

00:02:01.140 --> 00:02:03.470
He's Grandma Shizuka's right-hand man.

00:02:03.470 --> 00:02:05.480
Representing Kusatsu,
a boy who, for a moment,

00:02:05.480 --> 00:02:07.480
was potentially my fiancé,
Toriyama Noboru-kun, age 14.

00:02:07.480 --> 00:02:09.770
I will have Sana-chan!

00:02:10.810 --> 00:02:13.940
"Take Me To Kusatsu"

00:02:14.900 --> 00:02:16.820
♪ Kusatsu is such a nice place,
come on by at least once! ♪

00:02:16.820 --> 00:02:18.820
♪ Flowers blossom
even in the hot water! ♪

00:02:18.820 --> 00:02:19.820
--Okay!
--Okay!

00:02:19.820 --> 00:02:22.160
♪ Not even doctors
or the waters of Kusatsu ♪

00:02:22.160 --> 00:02:24.830
♪ are able to cure lovesickness! ♪

00:02:24.830 --> 00:02:26.830
♪ Kusatsu is such a nice place,
come on by at least once! ♪

00:02:26.830 --> 00:02:28.830
♪ Flowers blossom
even in the hot water! ♪

00:02:28.830 --> 00:02:32.130
Look, it's been almost two hours
since we left Ueno,

00:02:32.130 --> 00:02:33.500
and that's all you've been singing.

00:02:33.500 --> 00:02:34.500
Haven't you gotten tired of it?

00:02:34.500 --> 00:02:35.510
No, I haven't.

00:02:35.510 --> 00:02:36.510
I have.

00:02:36.510 --> 00:02:38.510
♪ Kusatsu is such a nice place,
come on by at least once! ♪

00:02:38.510 --> 00:02:40.510
♪ Flowers blossom
even in the hot water! ♪

00:02:40.510 --> 00:02:43.180
♪ Choina-sa no
choina-sa no choina-sa no sa! ♪

00:02:43.180 --> 00:02:45.470
--♪ Choina-sa no
choina-sa no choina-sa no sa! ♪
--Rei-kun, one more time!

00:02:45.470 --> 00:02:49.520
♪ Choina-sa no
choina-sa no choina-sa no sa! ♪

00:02:49.520 --> 00:02:52.190
Like I promised Grandma,

00:02:52.190 --> 00:02:55.860
Mama, Rei-kun and I are on our way to
Kusatsu hot springs for winter vacation.

00:02:55.860 --> 00:02:57.530
Although...

00:02:57.530 --> 00:03:00.450
Never mind me, Sana and Sagami-kun,
you two go on without me!

00:03:01.820 --> 00:03:04.160
Kusatsu is such a nice place,
let's go there once!

00:03:04.160 --> 00:03:07.750
I told you, I'm not going! It's obvious
that nothing good will come of it!

00:03:07.750 --> 00:03:10.500
No! No! No! No! No! No! No!

00:03:10.500 --> 00:03:12.790
Let's go, Sensei.

00:03:12.790 --> 00:03:13.790
Let's go.

00:03:13.790 --> 00:03:15.420
Put me down, Sagami.

00:03:15.880 --> 00:03:19.220
...Mama's heart doesn't seem to be in it.

00:03:19.220 --> 00:03:23.550
"The Path to Becoming
a Wonderful Head Clerk"

00:03:19.220 --> 00:03:21.840
"The joy of one's guests should be

00:03:21.840 --> 00:03:23.550
thought of as the greatest reward.

00:03:23.550 --> 00:03:28.220
"Never forget your smile
and grateful heart."

00:03:28.220 --> 00:03:32.810
If, as Sensei says, one of Shizuka-san's
plots really is waiting for us,

00:03:32.810 --> 00:03:34.190
then when it happens,

00:03:34.190 --> 00:03:37.860
I need to be prepared to
become the head clerk at any time.

00:03:37.860 --> 00:03:42.820
Yes. It is my calling that I must protect
Sana-chan for the rest of my life!

00:03:43.200 --> 00:03:45.830
Rei-kun, what are you reading?

00:03:45.830 --> 00:03:47.200
It's nothing! It's nothing!

00:03:47.200 --> 00:03:49.870
--Nagano-Kusatsuguchi...
--Show me! Show me!

00:03:49.870 --> 00:03:51.540
We're getting off. Get ready.

00:03:51.540 --> 00:03:53.170
Eh? We're here?

00:03:53.210 --> 00:03:54.830
Rei-kun! The suitcase! The suitcase!

00:03:54.830 --> 00:03:57.210
Right! Oof-

00:03:57.210 --> 00:04:01.550
H- heavy, isn't it?
What's in here, Sensei?

00:04:01.550 --> 00:04:02.550
It's a secret.

00:04:02.550 --> 00:04:04.550
Nice to see you made it.

00:04:04.550 --> 00:04:05.510
"Kurata Inn"

00:04:04.840 --> 00:04:07.510
Thank you for coming. Over here.

00:04:07.510 --> 00:04:09.220
It's Katagiri-san!

00:04:09.220 --> 00:04:14.190
Thank you for coming such along distance.
The Mistress is eagerly awaiting you.

00:04:14.560 --> 00:04:19.530
I have a bus waiting for us out front.
I will carry your baggage.

00:04:19.900 --> 00:04:23.200
Amazing. You'd expect as much from
a candidate to be the next head clerk.

00:04:23.240 --> 00:04:28.240
However, Katagiri-san, I, Sagami Rei,
will not be beaten out by you!

00:04:28.910 --> 00:04:31.500
Take it easy, there, take it easy.

00:04:31.500 --> 00:04:33.960
"Kurata Inn"

00:04:38.840 --> 00:04:40.510
--Welcome!

00:04:40.510 --> 00:04:44.130
Oh! We're really here! It's Kurata Inn!

00:04:45.180 --> 00:04:47.760
I will carry my own luggage!

00:04:50.520 --> 00:04:51.850
Yow...

00:04:51.850 --> 00:04:53.890
Are you okay?

00:04:55.190 --> 00:04:58.020
Did you hurt yourself?

00:04:58.860 --> 00:05:00.190
No, not at all...

00:05:00.190 --> 00:05:01.860
Hey, now!

00:05:01.860 --> 00:05:03.190
Grandma!

00:05:03.190 --> 00:05:05.200
Welcome, Sana-chan.

00:05:05.200 --> 00:05:06.200
Grandpa?

00:05:06.200 --> 00:05:08.530
Thanks for coming, Sana-chan.

00:05:08.530 --> 00:05:11.240
Sure! Thanks for having me!

00:05:12.540 --> 00:05:14.210
Excuse my long absence.

00:05:14.210 --> 00:05:17.210
Misako-san, it has been a while, huh?

00:05:17.210 --> 00:05:19.540
That's my daughter for you!
Well deflected.

00:05:19.540 --> 00:05:20.800
That was weird.

00:05:25.220 --> 00:05:27.550
I'm sliding! I'm sliding! Gleam!

00:05:27.550 --> 00:05:30.560
This sure does seem like a
long-established inn, huh Sensei?

00:05:30.560 --> 00:05:31.470
I suppose.

00:05:31.470 --> 00:05:33.470
Ah! Rei-kun, Rei-kun, look, look!

00:05:33.470 --> 00:05:34.480
"Bow your head!"

00:05:34.930 --> 00:05:37.480
"Mito Komon Commemorative Hall"

00:05:38.150 --> 00:05:42.820
These are the items that Mito Komon used
when he stayed at Kurata Inn, are they!?

00:05:42.820 --> 00:05:44.820
What are you so excited about?

00:05:44.820 --> 00:05:47.150
But there's no autographed signboard.

00:05:47.150 --> 00:05:49.160
Are you sure it was
really him who came here?

00:05:49.160 --> 00:05:51.490
What if it was actually
just a look-alike?

00:05:51.490 --> 00:05:54.160
Come, let's go to your rooms.

00:05:54.160 --> 00:05:56.500
They all have no dreams, huh?

00:05:56.500 --> 00:06:00.500
Oh, this is the toothbrush
that Suke-san used?

00:06:00.500 --> 00:06:02.380
"Toothbrush used by Suke-san"

00:06:00.840 --> 00:06:02.300
Toothbrush?

00:06:02.840 --> 00:06:06.880
This is Madam Misako-san
and Sana-san's room.

00:06:12.180 --> 00:06:13.510
What's that?

00:06:13.510 --> 00:06:14.180
That is...

00:06:14.180 --> 00:06:15.180
The yubatake.

00:06:15.180 --> 00:06:16.520
Yubatake?

00:06:16.520 --> 00:06:20.150
When it comes to things about Kusatsu,
let Kusatsu Babbit handle it!

00:06:21.190 --> 00:06:23.150
"Hot water field"

00:06:21.190 --> 00:06:23.860
Yubatake is written like this.

00:06:23.860 --> 00:06:26.530
The hot springs that come up
from beneath the ground in Kusatsu...

00:06:26.530 --> 00:06:31.200
...are very hot-
from 60 to 90 degrees!

00:06:31.200 --> 00:06:34.490
That hot spring water is
cooled a little bit here,

00:06:34.490 --> 00:06:36.830
and then distributed to
the inns throughout Kusatsu.

00:06:36.830 --> 00:06:38.160
Needless to say,

00:06:38.160 --> 00:06:40.500
the water for Kurata Inn's baths
comes from these springs.

00:06:40.500 --> 00:06:42.710
Now go ahead and have a bath!

00:06:43.840 --> 00:06:45.840
Father...

00:06:45.840 --> 00:06:49.510
How is it being back in
Kusatsu after ten-odd years?

00:06:49.510 --> 00:06:52.510
Just the way it was after
I left home to go to college.

00:06:52.510 --> 00:06:54.850
Forgive me for being
such a selfish daughter.

00:06:54.850 --> 00:06:59.520
Not at all, Misako-san.
I'm sorry I couldn't offer any help.

00:06:59.520 --> 00:07:01.230
By the way, Father...

00:07:02.190 --> 00:07:06.190
Any sign that Mother is
plotting something funny again?

00:07:06.190 --> 00:07:09.200
Let's see...
Nothing in particular right now...

00:07:09.200 --> 00:07:12.570
Really? Still, I can't
let my guard down.

00:07:21.870 --> 00:07:23.710
My, my!

00:07:27.210 --> 00:07:29.550
This water is terrific!

00:07:29.550 --> 00:07:31.470
We welcome you!

00:07:31.470 --> 00:07:33.680
"Obana Family"

00:07:31.470 --> 00:07:33.800
This is your room.

00:07:34.470 --> 00:07:36.600
Oh, Sagami-san!

00:07:38.140 --> 00:07:41.270
That's not such a bad life, huh?

00:07:47.150 --> 00:07:49.820
I spy three little stars!

00:07:49.820 --> 00:07:52.820
You're kidding!
What are you doing here?

00:07:52.820 --> 00:07:54.160
Family trip!

00:07:54.160 --> 00:07:56.830
Does that mean Hayama is here, too?

00:07:56.830 --> 00:07:59.160
Hayama! Hey!

00:07:59.160 --> 00:07:59.830
Yo.

00:07:59.830 --> 00:08:01.500
Hello.

00:08:01.500 --> 00:08:02.620
"Welcome, Hayama Family!!"

00:08:01.500 --> 00:08:02.750
Why is the Hayama Family here?

00:08:03.170 --> 00:08:07.250
We got a call from the mistress here,
saying she'd only charge us half price,

00:08:07.250 --> 00:08:09.510
so by all means, come stay.

00:08:09.510 --> 00:08:13.840
I haven't taken either Akito
or Natsumi anywhere in a while,

00:08:13.840 --> 00:08:17.180
and this was a good opportunity,
so I thought I'd take her up on it.

00:08:17.180 --> 00:08:19.310
Is that right?

00:08:22.520 --> 00:08:24.190
Snow!

00:08:24.190 --> 00:08:27.190
Snow! Snow! Hayama, is it
snowing on your side, too?

00:08:27.190 --> 00:08:30.820
Snow at a hot spring-
that's kind of cool, huh?

00:08:34.820 --> 00:08:36.490
Good afternoon.

00:08:36.490 --> 00:08:38.780
Why is Hayama-kun at your side!?

00:08:38.780 --> 00:08:40.830
When she came to Tokyo earlier,

00:08:40.830 --> 00:08:44.830
Grandma seems to have
taken a liking to Hayama.

00:08:44.830 --> 00:08:46.500
I like the look in his eyes!

00:08:46.500 --> 00:08:48.500
I smell conspiracy.

00:08:48.500 --> 00:08:52.470
My children and I have taken her up
on her offer. Here, have some more.

00:08:52.470 --> 00:08:54.430
Oh, thank you.

00:08:57.510 --> 00:09:01.020
Now then, if we could
ask Hayama Akito-kun's father

00:09:01.020 --> 00:09:02.180
to please lead us in a toast...

00:09:02.180 --> 00:09:04.850
Huh? Me?

00:09:04.850 --> 00:09:06.810
All right, if I may be so bold...

00:09:06.810 --> 00:09:09.480
We have three "fukuro" here.

00:09:09.480 --> 00:09:11.690
--The first is "ofukuro" ("mothers");
--Hold on, here.

00:09:11.690 --> 00:09:13.150
--the second is "ibukuro" ("stomachs");
--I think you have the wrong idea.

00:09:13.150 --> 00:09:16.530
--the third one is... I don't remember...
--This almost sounds like a wedding speech.

00:09:16.530 --> 00:09:17.530
Very good, very good.

00:09:17.530 --> 00:09:19.580
--Cheers!

00:09:23.160 --> 00:09:25.000
♪ Kusatsu hot springs
are warm and slippery, ♪

00:09:25.000 --> 00:09:26.830
♪ everyone come to Kurata Inn! ♪

00:09:26.830 --> 00:09:30.500
♪ In business since the Edo period,
even Mito Komon regularly stayed here! ♪

00:09:30.500 --> 00:09:32.460
♪ The food is delicious,
the waitresses are friendly, ♪

00:09:32.460 --> 00:09:34.130
♪ everyone come to Kurata Inn! ♪

00:09:34.130 --> 00:09:38.800
♪ I'm traveling with my son and daughter.
This is the paradise spot of Genma. ♪

00:09:38.800 --> 00:09:42.140
F- Father...

00:09:42.140 --> 00:09:44.730
Mama and Grandma, you look cool!

00:09:46.810 --> 00:09:49.150
Trying to set up a marriage
for Sana so soon?

00:09:49.150 --> 00:09:50.480
You certainly have everything arranged.

00:09:50.480 --> 00:09:52.610
It's just a small token of appreciation

00:09:52.610 --> 00:09:54.820
for the one who is looking
after my granddaughter.

00:09:54.820 --> 00:09:57.150
I should have known you'd
set your sights on Hayama-kun.

00:09:57.150 --> 00:10:01.490
What would you say to coming back to
Kusatsu and having us all live together?

00:10:01.490 --> 00:10:03.870
I am not coming back!!

00:10:05.160 --> 00:10:07.500
That dance was lovely.

00:10:07.500 --> 00:10:08.500
Thank you.

00:10:08.500 --> 00:10:10.500
What are you doing?

00:10:10.500 --> 00:10:13.340
Hayama-kun, do you like skiing?

00:10:15.170 --> 00:10:18.510
I've never been skiing.

00:10:18.510 --> 00:10:20.510
Skiing is fun.

00:10:20.510 --> 00:10:21.550
Yeah.

00:10:26.850 --> 00:10:31.770
Ah, how agonizing.
I wish we didn't grow old.

00:10:31.770 --> 00:10:34.440
What does the future
hold for Kurata Inn?

00:10:34.440 --> 00:10:39.660
Boss Kunisada is calling for
the Mistress. What should I do?

00:10:42.120 --> 00:10:46.450
Shh! Everyone will hear.
I'm coming now.

00:10:46.450 --> 00:10:50.460
You can go skiing in Kusatsu.
Skiing is so delightful.

00:10:50.460 --> 00:10:52.130
So then, Zenjiro-sensei-

00:10:52.130 --> 00:10:54.000
Yow!

00:10:58.470 --> 00:11:01.800
What's going on?

00:11:01.800 --> 00:11:05.970
Why don't you make up
your mind, already, Mistress?

00:11:11.480 --> 00:11:14.150
So you may say, Boss,

00:11:14.150 --> 00:11:17.480
but Kurata Inn has 300 years'
worth of history.

00:11:17.480 --> 00:11:20.490
If you don't have a successor,
it doesn't make any difference.

00:11:20.490 --> 00:11:22.160
Mistress, you're getting along in age.

00:11:22.160 --> 00:11:25.410
Just turn Kurata Inn entirely
over to me, Kunisada Chukichi,

00:11:25.410 --> 00:11:27.660
and go into retirement.

00:11:29.160 --> 00:11:30.500
Must be a dog.

00:11:30.500 --> 00:11:33.130
Yeah, a dog, no doubt about it.

00:11:35.170 --> 00:11:38.170
Gra- Grandma is in trouble!

00:11:38.170 --> 00:11:43.180
T- that was a threat just now, right?
It was, right? What do we do?

00:11:43.510 --> 00:11:45.510
She called him "Boss," right?

00:11:45.510 --> 00:11:48.970
"B- Boss"? It was "Boss," all right.

00:11:48.970 --> 00:11:51.850
This is starting to
sound like a period drama.

00:11:51.850 --> 00:11:54.610
Hayama, with your karate
and my Komawari steps,

00:11:54.610 --> 00:11:56.190
do you think we can do anything?

00:11:56.190 --> 00:11:58.190
Even if we take them on,
we should watch for a while,

00:11:58.190 --> 00:11:59.530
to see what the other side does, right?

00:11:59.530 --> 00:12:03.160
All right! Watch them first!
Watch them first, watch them first!

00:12:05.870 --> 00:12:07.910
I spy three little stars!

00:12:16.960 --> 00:12:18.630
We just need to press
a little more, huh Boss?

00:12:18.630 --> 00:12:21.970
Yeah. The Mistress is
almost ready to give up.

00:12:21.970 --> 00:12:24.090
When that happens,
this won't be Kurata Inn anymore,

00:12:24.130 --> 00:12:25.970
it will be Kunisada Inn.

00:12:25.970 --> 00:12:27.640
Excuse me.

00:12:27.640 --> 00:12:29.310
Careful there, little lady.

00:12:29.310 --> 00:12:32.270
When you think about it, you have
to feel sorry for the Mistress.

00:12:32.270 --> 00:12:34.270
After working so hard
looking after Kurata Inn,

00:12:34.270 --> 00:12:35.940
she has to turn it over to someone else,

00:12:35.940 --> 00:12:39.480
and all because she
doesn't have any heirs.

00:12:41.940 --> 00:12:43.950
But... but you heard
what he was saying!

00:12:43.950 --> 00:12:47.280
In any case, why don't you
discuss this with your mother?

00:12:47.280 --> 00:12:49.620
Sure! Let's talk to Mama!

00:12:49.620 --> 00:12:50.950
Don't do that!

00:12:50.950 --> 00:12:52.620
Grandma!

00:12:52.620 --> 00:12:55.290
Is it true Kurata Inn is being
taken away from you by that boss?

00:12:55.290 --> 00:12:57.790
Yeah, it may turn out that way.

00:12:57.790 --> 00:13:00.630
Misako has no intention of
taking over Kurata Inn, no matter what.

00:13:00.630 --> 00:13:02.920
We are an old couple, and you,
Sana-chan, our last hope,

00:13:02.920 --> 00:13:06.300
are still in grade school.

00:13:06.300 --> 00:13:08.640
But I'll be in middle school next year.

00:13:08.640 --> 00:13:12.020
But Sana-chan,
you have your job doing TV,

00:13:12.020 --> 00:13:15.060
so you'll just return home to Tokyo,
won't you?

00:13:16.980 --> 00:13:18.980
Oh, Sana-chan...

00:13:18.980 --> 00:13:23.320
Rei-kun, there's a chance that
I might be relocating to Kusatsu.

00:13:24.650 --> 00:13:28.950
This is finally starting

00:13:28.030 --> 00:13:28.990
"The Path to Becoming
a Wonderful Head Clerk"

00:13:28.950 --> 00:13:30.330
to become serious!

00:13:30.330 --> 00:13:31.910
It's not meant as a joke.

00:13:30.490 --> 00:13:31.950
"Do you like skiing?" (suki)(sukii)

00:13:31.990 --> 00:13:32.870
"Child's Toy Skiing Classroom"

00:13:34.580 --> 00:13:37.250
Are you okay, Zenjiro-sensei?

00:13:37.250 --> 00:13:38.580
Of course I am!

00:13:38.580 --> 00:13:41.300
Today, we welcome our
viewuhs to come join us!

00:13:41.300 --> 00:13:43.260
We're doing a Skiing Classroom
live broadcast!

00:13:43.260 --> 00:13:48.180
It's not too late for you kids
living near Kusatsu, so rush on down!

00:13:49.260 --> 00:13:52.600
Whoa, right away, we've got some
kids in goggles! Who are you guys?

00:13:52.600 --> 00:13:54.270
It's just little old me!

00:13:54.270 --> 00:13:56.600
Oh, it's you, Sana-chan.

00:13:56.600 --> 00:14:00.610
Zenjiro-sensei, this is the
first time we've ever been skiing.

00:14:00.610 --> 00:14:03.610
Not to worry, I'll give you
a crash course from scratch.

00:14:03.610 --> 00:14:06.610
But what do you guys
have on your feet there?

00:14:06.610 --> 00:14:10.280
Huh? These are Kusatsu's
famous yumomi boards.

00:14:10.280 --> 00:14:15.290
♪ Kusatsu is such a nice place,
come on by at least once! ♪

00:14:15.290 --> 00:14:17.290
--♪ Choina choina ♪

00:14:17.290 --> 00:14:20.630
Yumomi, you see, is done by taking
boards like these and stirring the water,

00:14:18.620 --> 00:14:23.250
"Yumomi" (hot water massaging)

00:14:20.630 --> 00:14:23.130
bringing down the temperature
of the hot spring water.

00:14:23.130 --> 00:14:27.630
I wonduh how the watuh is.
I'll just let myself in...

00:14:27.630 --> 00:14:30.970
Hot! Hot, hot, hot!

00:14:30.970 --> 00:14:32.600
Hot, hot!

00:14:32.600 --> 00:14:34.220
Oh, how embarrassing!

00:14:34.260 --> 00:14:36.890
We're the ones who are embarrassed!

00:14:36.890 --> 00:14:38.480
W- wait up!

00:14:39.560 --> 00:14:42.610
Yo, Hayama-kun, wasn't it?
Long time no see.

00:14:42.610 --> 00:14:44.900
Yahoo!

00:14:44.900 --> 00:14:47.900
You can't say you don't remember me!

00:14:47.950 --> 00:14:48.570
Who are you?

00:14:48.570 --> 00:14:50.570
You forgot!

00:14:50.610 --> 00:14:54.370
I... I am Sana-chan's betrothed!

00:14:56.620 --> 00:14:57.910
Oh.

00:14:57.960 --> 00:15:00.960
This is scary! Zenjiro-sensei!

00:15:00.960 --> 00:15:04.630
Remembuh, toin your skis to make
the lettuh "ha" to reduce speed.

00:15:04.630 --> 00:15:05.800
"Ha"
"Ha," you say?

00:15:05.800 --> 00:15:08.300
--The letter "ha"?

00:15:08.300 --> 00:15:09.300
We can't do that!

00:15:09.300 --> 00:15:11.260
Our legs are too short!

00:15:11.260 --> 00:15:14.260
You guys aren't trying to
make a hiragana "ha," are you?

00:15:14.300 --> 00:15:16.310
"Not 'ha,' but 'ha'..."

00:15:16.310 --> 00:15:19.600
You've got some nerve saying you're
in the running to take over Kurata Inn,

00:15:19.600 --> 00:15:21.980
when you're not even
able to ski properly.

00:15:21.980 --> 00:15:23.940
I never said I was.

00:15:23.940 --> 00:15:25.650
Are you running away from me!?

00:15:25.650 --> 00:15:29.320
I can't see! That hoits!
That tickles! Look out!

00:15:31.660 --> 00:15:34.700
"Tenguyama advanced level course lift"

00:15:35.580 --> 00:15:38.580
Y- you're getting on this? Stop!

00:15:38.580 --> 00:15:41.000
Right now,
Akito and the others are skiing,

00:15:41.000 --> 00:15:43.920
but I'd rather stay here
in the hot spring, you know?

00:15:43.920 --> 00:15:46.920
Yes, indeed. How is the water?

00:15:46.920 --> 00:15:48.920
The water is fine, isn't it?

00:15:48.920 --> 00:15:50.550
Yeah, sure.

00:15:55.600 --> 00:15:57.600
I'm going on ahead back!

00:15:57.600 --> 00:15:59.270
Huh? Where's Hayama?

00:15:59.270 --> 00:16:01.270
Akito? Oh no, is he lost?

00:16:01.270 --> 00:16:03.440
I know, I'll call him on this.

00:16:13.280 --> 00:16:15.950
This is the super-advanced course, here.

00:16:15.950 --> 00:16:17.700
Don't say I didn't tell you so.

00:16:17.700 --> 00:16:21.000
You're going to have to take off
your skis and walk down.

00:16:26.290 --> 00:16:30.960
Good grief, how could he forget me?
What a rude fellow!

00:16:30.960 --> 00:16:31.880
What's that, there?

00:16:31.880 --> 00:16:33.760
Watch out!

00:16:46.900 --> 00:16:48.230
--We're home!

00:16:48.230 --> 00:16:49.230
Welcome back.

00:16:49.230 --> 00:16:51.240
'lcome back.

00:16:51.240 --> 00:16:54.150
Wow, this is a supoib inn.

00:16:55.910 --> 00:16:57.910
Welcome back. Are you unhurt?

00:16:57.910 --> 00:17:01.250
Mm-hmm. Listen, Mama, incidentally,
has anything unusual been going on here?

00:17:01.250 --> 00:17:03.750
Anything scary happening,
or any scary faces?

00:17:05.920 --> 00:17:09.250
What's scary is Sagami-kun's
training to be head clerk.

00:17:09.250 --> 00:17:12.300
As for scary faces, there are
those guys hanging around over there.

00:17:14.930 --> 00:17:16.260
Where's Grandma?

00:17:16.260 --> 00:17:18.930
Beats me. I haven't seen her
at all since this morning,

00:17:18.930 --> 00:17:20.930
and have no idea what she's up to.

00:17:20.930 --> 00:17:25.940
It appears that the Kunisada family
intends at last to resort to violence.

00:17:27.600 --> 00:17:32.610
So my daughter, Natsumi,
says to me "Why not? Let's go!"

00:17:32.900 --> 00:17:36.490
Oh, yeah. My son has
recently taken up karate.

00:17:36.490 --> 00:17:38.240
He's growing up so fast...

00:17:38.240 --> 00:17:41.580
Boss! Here you are! Please hurry!

00:17:41.580 --> 00:17:44.910
All right. I wish you'd come sooner.

00:17:53.920 --> 00:17:55.260
Mistress, are you ready?

00:17:55.260 --> 00:17:56.680
Okay!

00:17:57.930 --> 00:17:59.640
Action!

00:18:02.930 --> 00:18:04.470
I won't wait any longer!

00:18:04.470 --> 00:18:07.940
Turn Kurata Inn over to
the Kunisada family right now-

00:18:07.940 --> 00:18:08.600
Boss!

00:18:08.600 --> 00:18:11.150
I- I'm fine...

00:18:16.610 --> 00:18:20.620
Today is the day you give me
a clear answer, Mistress!

00:18:20.620 --> 00:18:25.580
Are you going to hand over Kurata Inn,
or aren't you? Which is it!?

00:18:25.950 --> 00:18:30.290
It's no use arguing! The Kunisada clan
is taking over! You got that!?

00:18:30.290 --> 00:18:32.540
Just a minute!

00:18:35.210 --> 00:18:38.880
I won't allow Kurata Inn
to be turned over to you guys!

00:18:38.880 --> 00:18:42.350
What!? What do you mean?
Why won't you turn it over?

00:18:43.890 --> 00:18:47.480
Or I should say... you see...
what I mean is...

00:18:47.480 --> 00:18:49.900
this is my Grandmas precious inn, so...

00:18:49.900 --> 00:18:53.320
Are you saying that you're going
to inherit Kurata Inn, little lady?

00:18:53.320 --> 00:18:55.570
If so, that's another story.

00:18:55.570 --> 00:18:59.070
Well... I won't say that I never will,

00:18:59.070 --> 00:19:02.700
but I can't very well
do so right now, either...

00:19:12.250 --> 00:19:15.460
Enough of this insolence!
Let them have it!

00:19:19.930 --> 00:19:23.260
I was mistaken for the
head clerk earlier, you know.

00:19:23.260 --> 00:19:26.930
Oh, my. Well, anyone who looks
at you anymore sees a fine head clerk.

00:19:26.930 --> 00:19:29.600
Now you're embarrassing me.

00:19:29.600 --> 00:19:33.560
Now for the swashbuckling steps
I learned in Gekidan Komawari!

00:19:38.570 --> 00:19:40.570
"The Boss's Handbook"?

00:19:40.570 --> 00:19:42.910
Awl right, you!

00:19:42.910 --> 00:19:44.530
Who do you think I am!?

00:19:44.570 --> 00:19:48.580
I am the comedian... who makes
even crying children laugh...

00:19:48.580 --> 00:19:50.250
awl across Kansai... Zenjiro!

00:19:50.250 --> 00:19:52.420
...and Uchiyamada, too.

00:19:55.210 --> 00:19:59.590
I shall avenge Zenjiro-sensei
and Uchiyamada-kun! Defend yourselves!

00:19:59.590 --> 00:20:01.930
Do you not value
your grandmother's life?

00:20:01.930 --> 00:20:02.930
You coward!

00:20:02.930 --> 00:20:07.600
It's okay, Sana-chan! If this is as long
as I live, it will have been plenty!

00:20:07.600 --> 00:20:11.560
In exchange, please look after
what is left of Kurata Inn for me.

00:20:11.560 --> 00:20:12.940
Grandma!

00:20:12.940 --> 00:20:15.230
Please look after Kurata Inn.

00:20:15.230 --> 00:20:16.940
Grandma...

00:20:16.940 --> 00:20:19.860
How low the Kunisada family
has stooped,

00:20:19.860 --> 00:20:22.280
to engage in swordfight
with the elderly and children!

00:20:22.280 --> 00:20:23.280
Mama!

00:20:23.280 --> 00:20:25.950
If you sheath your swords and depart,
it will be well with you.

00:20:25.950 --> 00:20:30.700
Otherwise, I shall bring shame to you
by chopping you into fine cubes!

00:20:32.870 --> 00:20:35.210
Misako-san!

00:20:35.210 --> 00:20:39.550
Gotcha. Enough of this amateur charade.
I'm just about ready to go home.

00:20:39.550 --> 00:20:41.550
Anyone who wants to stay here, feel free.

00:20:41.550 --> 00:20:46.550
Mama, save Grandma! Boss Kunisada
is trying to take over Kurata Inn!

00:20:47.220 --> 00:20:51.180
Sana, Uncle Kunisada there
was one of Mother's classmates

00:20:51.180 --> 00:20:52.230
back in elementary school.

00:20:52.230 --> 00:20:53.890
C-classmate!?

00:20:53.890 --> 00:20:55.900
Okay then, I'm heading out.

00:21:04.910 --> 00:21:07.740
I have to buy gifts
for Hisae-chan and the others!

00:21:08.580 --> 00:21:10.240
Is it ovuh yet?

00:21:10.240 --> 00:21:11.790
I dunno...

00:21:12.580 --> 00:21:16.250
This week's Sana-chan.
Wow, pretty cool, huh?

00:21:16.250 --> 00:21:17.920
Sorry for lying to you.

00:21:17.920 --> 00:21:20.920
Mm-mm, it was lots of fun!

00:21:20.920 --> 00:21:23.260
Come back to Kusatsu
again once in a while.

00:21:23.260 --> 00:21:25.590
Please come again, everyone.

00:21:25.590 --> 00:21:28.260
We'd come even if you
told us not to come!

00:21:28.260 --> 00:21:33.270
Sana-chan and I share a common destiny.
Wherever she goes, I will go with her.

00:21:34.270 --> 00:21:35.940
Please take care.

00:21:35.940 --> 00:21:37.480
R- right!

00:21:39.610 --> 00:21:43.940
That boy saw through our act.
I'm liking him more and more!

00:21:43.940 --> 00:21:46.030
This does not mean that
I have given up, though!

00:21:46.030 --> 00:21:47.910
One day, without fail!

00:21:51.280 --> 00:21:53.950
What have you been reading
so intently all this time?

00:21:53.950 --> 00:21:55.290
Nothing special.

00:21:55.290 --> 00:21:57.290
How was your first ski trip?

00:21:57.290 --> 00:21:58.630
Didn't hate it.

00:21:58.630 --> 00:22:00.290
That's good.

00:22:00.290 --> 00:22:03.800
Now, to go back to Tokyo
with a fresh attitude,

00:22:03.800 --> 00:22:07.300
and apply myself to
the manager business again!

00:22:07.300 --> 00:22:09.640
Huh? That reminds me, it's lighter now.

00:22:09.640 --> 00:22:13.310
Sensei, what was inside this trunk?

00:22:13.310 --> 00:22:14.640
That's a secret.

00:22:14.640 --> 00:22:17.310
Mistress! Mistress!

00:22:17.310 --> 00:22:19.310
Step right up! Step right up!

00:22:19.310 --> 00:22:22.980
If you're in Kusatsu,
come on over to Kurata Inn!

00:22:22.980 --> 00:22:27.490
Hey, you there, Mister, passing by!
The acclaimed Kurata Inn is this way!

00:22:27.490 --> 00:22:29.910
This way! This way!

00:22:30.950 --> 00:22:32.950
Just a minute!

00:22:32.950 --> 00:22:36.290
Are we ending without me being
able to see my beloved Sana-chan?

00:22:36.290 --> 00:22:40.630
That's a pretty underhanded thing to do!

00:22:40.750 --> 00:22:42.250
"Back against the wall."

00:22:42.750 --> 00:22:47.760
That's what you say about times like these.

00:22:49.010 --> 00:22:52.510
In dire straits,

00:22:53.260 --> 00:22:56.100
I've been waiting for an answer.

00:22:56.600 --> 00:22:59.980
My confessions are worked out
long in advance,

00:23:00.940 --> 00:23:05.070
to always go along with the scenario.

00:23:05.280 --> 00:23:11.110
My heart may be settled, but my mind is in a...

00:23:11.320 --> 00:23:13.280
...panic!!

00:23:14.280 --> 00:23:19.120
When my friends invite me by, suddenly,

00:23:19.330 --> 00:23:21.830
he's there.

00:23:22.750 --> 00:23:25.090
And our usual classroom...

00:23:25.300 --> 00:23:27.670
...quick-changes into a merry-go-round...

00:23:27.800 --> 00:23:30.220
...for two.

00:23:31.050 --> 00:23:33.680
Although I've said nothing but wisecracks...

00:23:33.890 --> 00:23:38.430
...up to now, just for today,

00:23:39.350 --> 00:23:42.020
I'm going to be honest and sincere,

00:23:42.230 --> 00:23:46.730
so BOY, take a look my way!

00:23:47.650 --> 00:23:52.320
When my friends invite me by, suddenly,

00:23:52.490 --> 00:23:54.990
he's there,

00:23:55.910 --> 00:23:58.120
And our usual classroom...

00:23:58.410 --> 00:24:00.750
...quick-changes into a merry-go-round...

00:24:00.870 --> 00:24:03.250
...for two.

00:24:06.750 --> 00:24:09.420
Hoy! In Sana-chan's next adventures...

00:24:09.420 --> 00:24:12.430
How many more nights to sleep
until it's Christmas?

00:24:12.430 --> 00:24:14.470
On Christmas Eve,
do you remember what happens?

00:24:14.510 --> 00:24:16.760
It's me and Hayama's middle birthday!

00:24:16.760 --> 00:24:18.470
Let's get ready for the party!

00:24:18.470 --> 00:24:21.430
But before that happens,
there are some problems that come up.

00:24:21.430 --> 00:24:25.770
Next time on Kodomo no Omocha, Episode 37,
the tale of the duel in the wintry wind,

00:24:25.770 --> 00:24:30.440
Kiss! Fight! Karate and Trumpet

00:24:30.440 --> 00:24:34.860
"Kiss! Fight! Karate and Trumpet"?
I don't get it!
